%-loop over a loaded KDL file, whole thing as one inline chain
<ul > <:for item in {./items.kdl} > <li > {item.name}: {item.score}
% full form: one inline chain + indented siblings for the innermost element
<:for item in {./items.kdl} > <div class="row" > <a href="/{item.name}"
 <h > {item.name}
 <p > {item.score}